<p>I like this one, too. I agree with those who say that not every SCP needs to be horrific or dangerous.</p>
<p>But it could do with some more detail. It raises various intriguing questions in my mind about what exactly happens physically when you use it. For mechanical locks, I can imagine it morphing to become the right shape to open the lock. But what about electronic ones? For a keypad, maybe it grows fingers that push the buttons in the right order. What about card-swipes? Fingerprint readers? Card swipes?</p>
